
---
const title = "About Bezels | Anime Discovery Platform";
const description =
  "Learn about Bezels, an anime discovery platform designed to help fans find their next favourite anime.";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <title>{title}</title>

    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      body {
        background: #090d18;
        color: #f4f6ff;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 22px 8%;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #20283b;
      }

      .logo {
        color: white;
        font-size: 27px;
        font-weight: 800;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .logo span { color: #8b7cff; }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      nav a {
        color: #b9bfd1;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      nav a:hover { color: #a99aff; }

      main {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 75px 22px 90px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        color: #a99aff;
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 55px);
        margin: 18px 0 25px;
      }

      h1 span { color: #9685ff; }

      .intro {
        color: #b9bfd1;
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 1.9;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .content-section {
        margin-top: 35px;
      }

      .content-section h2 {
        font-size: 23px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .content-section p {
        color: #aab2c6;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.9;
      }

      .feature-list {
        margin: 15px 0 0 22px;
        color: #aab2c6;
        line-height: 2;
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .cta {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 35px;
        padding: 15px 23px;
        background: #7965f5;
        color: white;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      footer {
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #20283b;
        padding: 28px 20px;
        color: #828da5;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      footer a {
        color: #a99aff;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin: 0 8px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 650px) {
        header {
          padding: 20px;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 18px;
        }

        nav {
          justify-content: center;
          gap: 13px;
        }

        nav a { font-size: 12px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header>
      <a class="logo" href="/">BEZELS<span>.</span></a>

      <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/find-anime/">Find Anime</a>
        <a href="/anime-quiz/">Anime Quiz</a>
        <a href="/watchlist/">My Watchlist</a>
        <a href="/articles/">Articles</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <span class="eyebrow">GET TO KNOW US</span>

      <h1>About <span>Bezels.</span></h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Bezels is an anime discovery platform created to help fans
        explore new series, find recommendations and organise their
        anime watching journey.
      </p>

      <section class="content-section">
        <h2>Why We Created Bezels</h2>
        <p>
          Choosing what to watch next can sometimes be difficult.
          With so many anime series across different genres and
          storytelling styles, finding something that matches
          your interests takes time.
          <br /><br />
          Bezels aims to make that discovery process simpler through
          practical recommendation tools and helpful anime guides.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <h2>What You Can Do on Bezels</h2>
        <p>
          Our platform includes features designed to make anime
          discovery easier:
        </p>

        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Find anime using quick filters and preferences.</li>
          <li>Take a detailed quiz to explore recommendations.</li>
          <li>Save anime to your personal watchlist.</li>
          <li>Organise titles you want to watch and have watched.</li>
          <li>Explore anime-related articles and guides.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          We aim to provide a simple, useful and easy-to-navigate
          experience for anime fans. Recommendations are based
          on the preferences selected by visitors, and our
          platform will continue to improve as we expand its
          anime database and content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <h2>Our Goal</h2>
        <p>
          Our goal is to build a helpful place where anime fans
          can discover stories they might otherwise miss and
          keep track of the series they enjoy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <a class="cta" href="/find-anime/">Discover Anime</a>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>© 2026 Bezels. Made for anime fans.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">
        <a href="/articles/">Articles</a>
        <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>
      </p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
